{"seq":2,"slug":"player-segments-ltv","title":"玩家分层与 LTV","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/foundations/player-segments-ltv","wordCount":1367,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"玩家分层与-ltv\">玩家分层与 LTV</h1><p>免费游戏有一个反直觉的事实：绝大多数玩家一分钱都不会花，而收入几乎全部来自一小撮人。一款典型的免费手游里，付费玩家可能只占总用户的百分之二到五，而其中最顶端的少数人又贡献了这点付费里的大半。理解这种极端集中的分布，并学会用生命周期价值给一个玩家标价，是判断「这门生意是否成立」的起点——它直接决定了买量花多少钱才划算、运营该向哪类人倾斜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>业界习惯用海洋生物给付费玩家分层：鲸鱼、海豚、小鱼，再加上压根不付费的免费玩家。这套分层不是为了贴标签，而是因为不同层级的人数、付费额与运营策略截然不同。下图把一款典型免费游戏的玩家金字塔与价值贡献画在一起。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[全体玩家 100%] --&gt; B[免费玩家&lt;br/&gt;约 95%-98%]&#10;  A --&gt; C[付费玩家&lt;br/&gt;约 2%-5%]&#10;  C --&gt; D[小鱼 Minnows&lt;br/&gt;小额低频]&#10;  C --&gt; E[海豚 Dolphins&lt;br/&gt;中额规律]&#10;  C --&gt; F[鲸鱼 Whales&lt;br/&gt;大额高频]&#10;  B -.贡献广告收入.-&gt; G[总收入]&#10;  D -.少量内购.-&gt; G&#10;  E -.稳定内购.-&gt; G&#10;  F -.收入大头.-&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[全体玩家 100%] --&gt; B[免费玩家&lt;br/&gt;约 95%-98%]\n  A --&gt; C[付费玩家&lt;br/&gt;约 2%-5%]\n  C --&gt; D[小鱼 Minnows&lt;br/&gt;小额低频]\n  C --&gt; E[海豚 Dolphins&lt;br/&gt;中额规律]\n  C --&gt; F[鲸鱼 Whales&lt;br/&gt;大额高频]\n  B -.贡献广告收入.-&gt; G[总收入]\n  D -.少量内购.-&gt; G\n  E -.稳定内购.-&gt; G\n  F -.收入大头.-&gt; G</pre><p>下表把各层的典型画像与对应的运营重心列出来，作为后续设计的依据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>人数占比</th>\n<th>付费特征</th>\n<th>价值角色</th>\n<th>运营重心</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免费玩家</td>\n<td>95%-98%</td>\n<td>不付费</td>\n<td>看广告、撑生态、社交分母</td>\n<td>留存与广告变现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小鱼</td>\n<td>付费者多数</td>\n<td>小额、偶发</td>\n<td>转化的起点</td>\n<td>首充与低价礼包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海豚</td>\n<td>付费者中段</td>\n<td>中额、规律</td>\n<td>稳定基本盘</td>\n<td>通行证与订阅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鲸鱼</td>\n<td>付费者极少数</td>\n<td>大额、高频</td>\n<td>收入核心</td>\n<td>VIP 服务与高价值内容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么收入如此集中\">为什么收入如此集中</h2><p>收入向鲸鱼集中，是免费模式的结构性结果而非意外。当付费没有上限、且高付费玩家能持续获得新的付费理由（更强的角色、更稀有的外观、更高的排名），少数重度玩家的累计消费会迅速拉开与普通付费者的差距。这也是为什么<a href=\"../monetization-design/gacha-battle-pass\">抽卡与战斗通行证</a>这类「付费无封顶」的机制如此关键——它们为鲸鱼提供了几乎无限的消费空间。</p>\n<p>但过度依赖鲸鱼是危险的。收入集中意味着脆弱：少数大额玩家流失就能让收入塌方。健康的产品会同时经营海豚与小鱼，把收入结构做厚，并通过广告让免费玩家也贡献价值。如何让免费玩家不白嫖，见<a href=\"../monetization-design/ads-hybrid\">广告变现与混合变现</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期价值的计算\">生命周期价值的计算</h2><p>生命周期价值（LTV）回答一个核心问题：一个玩家在他的整个游戏生命里，平均会带来多少收入。最朴素的形式是把人均日收入乘以平均生命周期：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LTV</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>ARPDAU</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Lifetime</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LTV} = \\text{ARPDAU} \\times \\text{Lifetime}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LTV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ARPDAU</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Lifetime</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中平均生命周期可由留存曲线推得。若把留存近似为指数衰减，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 天的留存率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(t) = e^{-\\lambda t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则平均生命周期等于留存曲线下的面积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Lifetime</mtext><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>λ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Lifetime} = \\int_{0}^{\\infty} e^{-\\lambda t}\\, dt = \\frac{1}{\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Lifetime</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3262em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4143em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实务中更常用离散求和，把每日留存率累加：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Lifetime</mtext><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Lifetime} = \\sum_{t=0}^{T} r(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Lifetime</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2809em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这条留存曲线本身的形态、以及次留七留三十留的定义，属于<a href=\"../liveops/retention-engagement\">留存与参与度</a>的范畴，本篇只取用其结果。ARPDAU 的精确口径则见<a href=\"../analytics-ethics/metrics-funnels\">核心指标与漏斗</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ltv-与-cac-生意是否成立\">LTV 与 CAC：生意是否成立</h2><p>LTV 单独看没有意义，必须和获客成本（CAC）放在一起。买量投放的铁律是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LTV</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>CAC</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LTV} &gt; \\text{CAC}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LTV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当一个玩家的生命周期价值超过把他买进来的成本，投放才不是亏本买卖。业界常用 LTV/CAC 比值衡量健康度，通常认为该比值需稳定在 3 倍以上才有足够的运营与利润空间。下表给出一个简化的回收测算示例。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>数值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ARPDAU</td>\n<td>$0.30</td>\n<td>IAP 偏重型游戏的健康线（<a href=\"https://www.gameanalytics.com/reports/2026-mobile-pc-gaming-benchmarks\">GameAnalytics, 2026</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均生命周期</td>\n<td>60 天</td>\n<td>由留存曲线求和得出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LTV</td>\n<td>$18.0</td>\n<td>ARPDAU × 生命周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CAC</td>\n<td>$5.0</td>\n<td>单次安装的买量成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LTV/CAC</td>\n<td>3.6</td>\n<td>高于 3，投放健康</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分层驱动的运营策略\">分层驱动的运营策略</h2><p>把玩家分层之后，运营就能做差异化而非一刀切。对免费玩家，重点是用激励广告与社交把他们留下来、并推动向小鱼转化；对小鱼，首充礼包与低价限时包是把第一笔钱掏出来的关键；对海豚，战斗通行证与订阅提供「花得不多但持续」的稳定通道；对鲸鱼，则需要 VIP 体系、专属客服与高价值限定内容来维系。这种按层定制的活动设计，正是第三章<a href=\"../liveops/liveops-events\">活动与版本节奏</a>的发力点，而每一类策略是否真的有效，要靠<a href=\"../analytics-ethics/ab-experimentation\">A/B 实验与优化</a>来验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>免费游戏收入极端集中：付费者仅占 2%-5%，鲸鱼又贡献了付费里的大头。</li>\n<li>鲸鱼、海豚、小鱼、免费玩家四层人数与价值角色各异，运营须差异化。</li>\n<li>LTV = ARPDAU × 平均生命周期；生命周期由留存曲线积分或求和得到。</li>\n<li>LTV 必须与 CAC 对比，LTV/CAC 稳定高于 3 才说明生意成立。</li>\n<li>收入过度依赖鲸鱼会让产品脆弱，应同时做厚海豚、小鱼与广告长尾。</li>\n<li>本篇是 hub 内 LTV 数学的唯一详述处；留存曲线与 ARPDAU 口径分别在持续运营章与数据章细讲。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"玩家分层与 LTV","id":"玩家分层与-ltv"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么收入如此集中","id":"为什么收入如此集中"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期价值的计算","id":"生命周期价值的计算"},{"level":2,"text":"LTV 与 CAC：生意是否成立","id":"ltv-与-cac-生意是否成立"},{"level":2,"text":"分层驱动的运营策略","id":"分层驱动的运营策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"变现模式总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/foundations/monetization-models"},"next":{"title":"定价与虚拟经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/foundations/economy-pricing"}}